@startuml
title SC-ORD-017 — An administrator rejects a paid order
actor Administrator as A
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Notification" as N

note over O #FFF8E1 : SUSPENDED, remembers CONFIRMING_STOCK\norder UNDER_REVIEW, payment captured
note over I #ECEFF1 : still down: ConfirmReservation\nwaits in its subscription
A -> O : RejectOrderUnderReview, with a comment
note over O : REFUNDING_PAYMENT\nrejection decided: ADMIN_DECISION
O ->> P : RefundPayment
P -> PSP : refund
PSP --> P : refunded
P ->> O : PaymentRefunded
O ->> I : ReleaseReservation
note over O #FFCDD2 : COMPENSATED\norder REJECTED, ADMIN_DECISION
O ->> N : OrderRejected (payment refunded)
== the inventory is back ==
note over I : ConfirmReservation first:\nthe units leave the stock
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note over O : saga ended, but the fact is kept:\nstock taken for a rejected order
O ->> I : ReturnStock
note over I : ReleaseReservation: nothing held,\nthe stock was taken
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note right of O : return already requested:\nrecorded, no effect
note over I : ReturnStock: units back on hand,\nreservation RETURNED
I ->> O : StockReturned
note right of O : recorded
@enduml
